  "id": "dual-consciousness",
  "term": "dual consciousness",
  "definition": "Dual consciousness is a historical term for a marked split between two states of awareness or personality, especially described in relation to somnambulism. In this older usage, a person could appear rational in the second state yet have different memory and self-experience across the two states, with the condition viewed as a complete form of somnambulism.",
